<section class="panel"><h2>Requests and response reminders</h2><p>Email verification is only one identity check. Record proportionate verification, lawful grounds, exceptions and decisions. The response-date reminder is configurable and is not legal advice. Access exports go to staff for review; nothing is released to requesters automatically.</p><?php foreach($rows as $r):?><p><a href="<?= e(m_admin_url('privacy',['id'=>$r['id']]).'#request') ?>"><?= e($r['reference'].' · '.$r['kind'].' · '.$r['state'].' · '.$r['email']) ?></a><br>Review by <?= e($r['due_at']) ?> UTC<?= strtotime($r['due_at'].' UTC')<=time()?' · DUE':'' ?></p><?php endforeach;?></section>
