<section class="panel"><h2>Anonymize a reviewed record</h2><p>Irreversible. This revokes tracking/invitations, scrubs personal answers and notes, removes personal evaluations and queues private attachment deletion. It does not erase off-host copies or other records for the same person. Review each matching record separately. A selected production record needs the additional policy confirmation.</p><?php o_form('privacy','anonymize');o_select('scope','Record type',array_combine(array_keys(V_SCOPES),array_keys(V_SCOPES)));o_input('subject_id','Record ID','number','',true);o_input('request_id','Matching verified deletion request ID (blank for expired retention)','number');o_input('typed_reference','Type the exact reference, or current subscriber email','text','',true);o_input('reason','Reviewed lawful grounds and decision — private','textarea','',true);o_select('production_review','Selected production/contract policy reviewed',['0'=>'Not applicable / not reviewed','1'=>'Yes — reviewed and authorized deletion']);o_input('confirm_code','Your current private code','password','',true);o_button('Anonymize this record');?></section>
<section class="panel"><h2>Reviewed production content erasure</h2><p>For approved privacy decisions only. Archive the affected content first. Manually verify that the email-verified requester is the subject and that contractual/legal holds permit erasure. This exceptionally scrubs all historical text/actor metadata of the chosen record; it does not automatically identify related film posts.</p><?php o_form('privacy','production_erase');o_input('item_id','Archived CMS record ID','number','',true);o_input('request_id','Verified deletion request ID','number','',true);o_input('typed_reference','Exact current archived slug','text','',true);o_select('production_review','Identity, production policy and legal holds reviewed',['0'=>'Not reviewed','1'=>'Reviewed and authorized']);o_input('reason','Reviewed basis and subject association','textarea','',true);o_input('confirm_code','Your current private code','password','',true);o_button('Erase reviewed archived production content');?></section>
