<section class="panel"><h2>Backup and restoration reminders</h2><p><?= !$last||strtotime($last['completed_at'].' UTC')<time()-max(1,(int)($config['backups']['reminder_days']??14))*86400?'BACKUP DUE: prepare a fresh encrypted off-host copy.':'A recent complete backup is recorded.' ?></p><p><?= !$last||$last['offhost_note']===''?'OFF-HOST COPY NOT RECORDED.':'Off-host copy: '.e($last['offhost_note']) ?></p><p><?= !$last||$last['restore_note']===''?'RESTORATION TEST NOT RECORDED.':'Restoration note: '.e($last['restore_note']) ?></p><p>Each part is encrypted with AES-256-GCM and a separately held passphrase. Start pauses mutations for at most 20 minutes; prepare/download every part, including the completion manifest. Expired/incomplete sets cannot restore. No cloud upload or automatic off-host copy is performed. Keep passphrase separately; loss means no recovery.</p>
